<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 107-2 V PAKISTAN BOARD XI AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 107-2 V PAKISTAN BOARD XI AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan. 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 107-2 in</p>
<p>their second innings at the close on the second day of the</p>
<p>three-day match against a Pakistan Board XI on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 307-8 declared and 107-2; Pakistan Board XI</p>
<p>236-8 declared.</p>
</text>
